<title>UK: WestLB sets $200 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets $200 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    02.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1875  PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND UST</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/UK/DE/NETH ANTILLES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
